<title>INDONESIA: Bimantara signs car pact with Hyundai.</title>
<headline>Bimantara signs car pact with Hyundai.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian conglomerate PT Bimantara Citra signed an agreement with South Korea's Hyundai Motor Co on Thursday to form a joint-venture company to produce cars in Indonesia.</p>
</text>
